    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Here is the slip that costs the most marks.\n\n24 − (13 − 6)\n\nThe minus sign in front belongs to the whole package:\n\n24 − 7 = 17",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_3_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_3_step": {
      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If you open the bracket instead of simplifying inside it, the minus flips every sign inside:\n\n24 − (13 − 6)\n= 24 − 13 + 6\n= 17\n\nSame answer, two safe routes.\nThe unsafe route: 24 − 13 − 6 = 5. The minus reaches only the 13 if you forget the flip.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_3"
        }
      ]
    },
