      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now a full-size package tower:\n\n100 − [40 + {30 − (20 − 10)}]\n\nDeepest box first:\n\n(20 − 10) = 10\n{30 − 10} = 20\n[40 + 20] = 60\n100 − 60 = 40",
