      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now the outer bracket:\n\np − [−q]\n= p + q\n\nNotice the double flip: a minus in front of a bracket that already starts with a minus.\n\nSlow is fast here — one layer, one line.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
